---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Dog-to-Dog Reactivity San Jacinto | Good Doggos";
const description = "Solve dog-to-dog reactivity in San Jacinto. We specialize in shifting focus and providing Balanced Clarity to help your dog coexist peacefully with others.";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Dog-to-Dog Reactivity Modification",
  "description": description,
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "name": "Good Doggos",
    "url": "https://gooddoggos.com",
    "telephone": "+19514016252",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "San Jacinto",
      "addressRegion": "CA",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "AdministrativeArea",
    "name": "Riverside County"
  },
  "url": "https://gooddoggos.com/services/dog-to-dog-reactivity"
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Hero Band -->
  <section class="bg-primary-navy pt-32 pb-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-body text-white/50 mt-6 mb-4" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Home</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/leash-reactivity-bootcamp" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Leash Reactivity Bootcamp</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <span class="text-white/80 truncate">Dog-to-Dog Reactivity</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
        Dog-to-Dog Reactivity Modification in San Jacinto
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body Content -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 bg-[#FCF9FA]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          There is nothing quite like the "walk of shame" through a San Jacinto neighborhood when your dog is screaming because they saw a Golden Retriever three blocks away. Your shoulders are sore, your stress is high, and you’ve memorized every side street near Mistletoe Park just to avoid an explosion.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          These reactive outbursts are symptoms of frustration and a lack of clear direction. Because we are professionals, we do not guess or give out generic advice. We must evaluate your dog in person to understand their specific triggers before we can help them coexist peacefully with others.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-primary-navy mt-12 mb-6">
          Breaking the Reactive Cycle
        </h2>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          At Good Doggos, I specialize in the dogs that other trainers label "unfixable." For 8 years, I’ve been the go-to for Riverside County owners who are ready to solve the problem rather than just managing the outbursts. My balanced approach isn't about suppressing your dog; it's about "Balanced Clarity" and shifting their focus.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          Take the case of Camila, a reactive Pitbull/Boxer mix. Her owner was told she'd never be able to be around other dogs and should be put down. On her first day with me, Camila was walking and laying down peacefully with my helper dog, Simba. By using Simba to provide natural canine feedback and my own clear corrections to interrupt her "loading" phase, we changed her entire state of mind.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          We take the work to the real-world environments of San Jacinto, from busy State Street to the distractions at Hiram Deville Park. Whether the heat is cranking up or the Santa Ana winds are blowing, your dog needs to know that you are the most relevant thing in their environment. I teach you how to read the subtle body language before the "Red Zone" hits, giving you the tools to advocate for your dog and maintain peace.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6 font-bold">
          You shouldn't have to wait until midnight to walk your dog in peace. Let’s get to work.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     CTA BAND
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#FBF1E9]" style="border-top: 1px solid #E6DAC6;">
  <div class="w-full h-[3px]" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #0F6D72, #D1B27F, #0F6D72);"></div>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 md:py-24 text-center">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-4" style="color: rgba(15,109,114,0.60);">Your Dog Is Next</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4" style="color: #0B2744;">
      Ready to See What's Possible?<br/>
      <span class="headline-accent" style="color: #D1B27F; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700;">Start With a Free Assessment.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.60);">
      Tell us about your dog. We'll do an honest assessment and point you toward the right program — or tell you if we're not the right fit.
    </p>
    <a href="/apply"
       class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
       style="background: #D1B27F; color: #0B2744; padding: 18px 44px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(209,178,127,0.35);">
      Apply for Free Behavioral Assessment →
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.40);">Takes less than 3 minutes · No commitment required</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
